{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcRxf4YxLp5VfcYiLshV", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I sampled one frame every 10 seconds from each of the ten videos and averaged each frame down to a single color. Side to Side (B) is the only one that stays blue and blue-grey from start to finish, with dark navy and purple tones in the second half. That fits the barcode, which is almost all blue, slate and navy, with a few thin red stripes and black at the end.\n\nNone of the others come close:\n- Dark Horse (A), All About That Bass (F) and Sugar (J) run warm, pink or tan.\n- Roar (E) and Hello (G) are green, olive or sepia.\n- Starboy (C) is mostly black with red.\n- Swalla (D), Love Me Like You Do (H) and This Is What You Came For (I) jump between very different colors and don't hold a steady blue.\n\nThis was a quick comparison of sampled colors, not a stripe-by-stripe match against the barcode, but B is clearly the best fit.\n\nAnswer: B"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1618, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6502, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1618}, "output_tokens": 9, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "776500fb-9130-4e4d-ae91-669bdeec97c4", "uuid": "fd9e2a98-46dd-48f0-8d58-b97905a27305", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:03:36.024Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcRxefW4zQUQedueXWJF"}
